<body>
	<a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to main content</a>
	<header class="sk-header site-header" id="site-header">
		<div class="sk-header__inner">
			<a class="site-brand" href="/" aria-label="Kujo home"><img src="assets/images/kujo-logomark.svg" alt="" width="28" height="28"><span>Kujo</span></a>
			<nav class="desktop-navigation" aria-label="Primary">
				<ul><li><a href="/language/" class="text-primary hover:underline">Language</a></li><li><a href="/examples/" class="text-primary hover:underline">Examples</a></li><li><a href="/ecosystem/" class="text-primary hover:underline">Ecosystem</a></li><li><a href="https://docs.kujolang.ai/" class="text-primary hover:underline">Docs</a></li><li><a href="/writing/" class="text-primary hover:underline">Writing</a></li><li><a href="https://github.com/kujolang/kujo" class="text-primary hover:underline">GitHub</a></li></ul>
			</nav>
			<div class="sk-header__actions">
				<button class="sk-button header-docs" type="button" data-variant="secondary" data-quick-install-open>Quick Install</button>
				<button class="sk-button mobile-menu-button" type="button" data-variant="secondary" data-mobile-menu-toggle aria-controls="mobile-navigation" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Menu, open navigation"><span data-mobile-menu-label>Menu</span></button>
			</div>
		</div>
	</header>

	<div class="mobile-drawer-shell" data-mobile-menu-shell>
		<div class="sk-drawer-scrim" data-mobile-menu-scrim hidden aria-hidden="true"></div>
		<aside class="sk-drawer" id="mobile-navigation" data-mobile-navigation hidden aria-hidden="true" aria-label="Mobile navigation">
			<nav aria-label="Mobile navigation"><ul><li><a href="/language/" class="text-primary hover:underline">Language</a></li><li><a href="/examples/" class="text-primary hover:underline">Examples</a></li><li><a href="/ecosystem/" class="text-primary hover:underline">Ecosystem</a></li><li><a href="https://docs.kujolang.ai/" class="text-primary hover:underline">Docs</a></li><li><a href="/writing/" class="text-primary hover:underline">Writing</a></li><li><a href="https://github.com/kujolang/kujo" class="text-primary hover:underline">GitHub</a></li></ul></nav>
			<button class="sk-button" type="button" data-quick-install-open>Quick Install</button>
		</aside>
	</div>
	<div class="quick-install-modal" data-quick-install-modal hidden>
		<div class="quick-install-modal__backdrop" data-quick-install-close></div>
		<section class="quick-install-modal__dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="quick-install-title" tabindex="-1">
			<header>
				<div><p class="eyebrow">Kujo Installer</p><h2 id="quick-install-title">Quick Install</h2></div>
				<button class="icon-button" type="button" data-quick-install-close aria-label="Close quick install"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></button>
			</header>
			<p>Install Kujo and the local-first ecosystem, or choose the focused Agent Development Platform.</p>
			<p class="install-option-label">Default toolchain</p>
			<div class="install-copy-field">
				<input type="text" readonly value="curl -fsSL https://kujolang.ai/install.sh | bash" aria-label="Kujo install command">
				<span class="copy-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-copy-status data-scramble-skip></span>
				<button class="icon-button copy-icon-button" type="button" data-copy-install aria-label="Copy install command">
					<svg class="copy-icon copy-icon--copy" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 8m-2 0a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v10a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H8a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><path d="M16 6V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v10a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2"/></svg>
					<svg class="copy-icon copy-icon--check" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 5 5L20 7"/></svg>
				</button>
			</div>
			<p class="install-option-label">Agent Development Platform</p>
			<div class="install-copy-field">
				<input type="text" readonly value="curl -fsSL https://kujolang.ai/install.sh | bash -s -- --group agent" aria-label="Kujo Agent Development Platform install command">
				<span class="copy-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-copy-status data-scramble-skip></span>
				<button class="icon-button copy-icon-button" type="button" data-copy-install data-copy-label="Copy agent install command" data-copied-label="Agent install command copied" aria-label="Copy agent install command">
					<svg class="copy-icon copy-icon--copy" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 8m-2 0a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v10a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H8a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><path d="M16 6V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v10a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2"/></svg>
					<svg class="copy-icon copy-icon--check" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 5 5L20 7"/></svg>
				</button>
			</div>
			<p>Developers can also <a href="assets/prompts/kujo-agent-onboarding.txt" data-agent-prompt-open>give the setup prompt to a coding agent</a>.</p>
		</section>
	</div>
	<div class="quick-install-modal agent-prompt-modal" data-agent-prompt-modal hidden>
		<div class="quick-install-modal__backdrop" data-agent-prompt-close></div>
		<section class="quick-install-modal__dialog agent-prompt-modal__dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="agent-prompt-title" tabindex="-1">
			<header>
				<div><p class="eyebrow">Agent Onboarding</p><h2 id="agent-prompt-title">Give this prompt to your agent</h2></div>
				<button class="icon-button" type="button" data-agent-prompt-close aria-label="Close agent onboarding prompt"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></button>
			</header>
			<p>Copy the prompt below and send it to your coding agent to install Kujo, add the ecosystem skills, and verify its setup.</p>
			<div class="agent-prompt-copy-field">
				<textarea readonly aria-label="Kujo agent onboarding prompt" data-agent-prompt-text>Loading prompt…</textarea>
				<div class="agent-prompt-copy-actions">
					<span class="copy-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-copy-status data-scramble-skip></span>
					<button class="sk-button copy-icon-button" type="button" data-copy-agent-prompt data-copy-label="Copy prompt" data-copied-label="Prompt copied" aria-label="Copy prompt" disabled>
						<span>Copy prompt</span>
						<svg class="copy-icon copy-icon--copy" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 8m-2 0a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v10a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H8a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><path d="M16 6V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v10a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2"/></svg>
						<svg class="copy-icon copy-icon--check" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 5 5L20 7"/></svg>
					</button>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</div>

	<main id="main-content" class="language-home">
<section class="sk-hero home-hero" aria-labelledby="home-hero-title">
<div class="home-hero__media" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/images/home-agent-workflow.webp" srcset="/assets/images/home-agent-workflow-640.webp 640w, /assets/images/home-agent-workflow-960.webp 960w, /assets/images/home-agent-workflow-1280.webp 1280w, /assets/images/home-agent-workflow.webp 1672w" sizes="100vw" alt="" width="1672" height="941" fetchpriority="high"></div><div class="home-hero__wash" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="sk-hero__inner"><div class="home-hero__copy"><h1 id="home-hero-title">Trust at the speed of AI.</h1><p class="home-hero__body">Kujo is a programming language for scripts, services and AI tools. Run your code locally, replay model responses and check the results.</p><div class="sk-hero__actions"><a class="sk-button" href="/language/">Get Started</a><a class="sk-button" data-variant="secondary" href="/examples/">View Examples</a></div></div></div></section>
<!-- LANGUAGE EXPLORER START -->
<section class="language-section home-explorer" aria-labelledby="code-title" data-code-explorer><header class="home-explorer-heading"><div><h2 id="code-title">A feel for the language</h2></div><a href="/examples/">All examples ↗</a></header><div class="example-selector" hidden><label for="home-example">Choose an example</label><select id="home-example"><option value="hello-world">Hello World</option><option value="functions">Functions and operators</option><option value="collections">Collections</option><option value="async">Async tasks</option><option value="request-hash" selected>Deterministic AI request IDs</option><option value="replay">AI calls and replay</option></select></div><article class="example-panel" id="example-hello-world" data-example="hello-world" data-category="Basics"><p class="eyebrow">Basics · Executed offline</p><h3>Hello World</h3><p>Print your first message.</p><div class="sample-code"><pre tabindex="0"><code><span class="syntax-token syntax-comment"># Expected output:</span>
<span class="syntax-token syntax-comment"># Kujo Kujo!</span>

print(<span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;Kujo Kujo!&quot;</span>)
</code></pre><button type="button" class="sk-button code-copy-icon" data-copy-code aria-label="Copy code" title="Copy code" hidden><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="8" y="8" width="12" height="12" rx="1.5"/><path d="M16 8V4H4v12h4"/></svg></button><span role="status" data-code-status></span></div><p>Save as <a href="/samples/hello-world.kujo" download>hello-world.kujo</a>, then:</p><div class="sample-code"><pre tabindex="0"><code>kujo run hello-world.kujo</code></pre><button type="button" class="sk-button code-copy-icon" data-copy-code aria-label="Copy code" title="Copy code" hidden><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="8" y="8" width="12" height="12" rx="1.5"/><path d="M16 8V4H4v12h4"/></svg></button><span role="status" data-code-status></span></div><details><summary>Expected output</summary><div class="sample-code"><pre tabindex="0"><code>Kujo Kujo!
</code></pre><button type="button" class="sk-button code-copy-icon" data-copy-code aria-label="Copy code" title="Copy code" hidden><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="8" y="8" width="12" height="12" rx="1.5"/><path d="M16 8V4H4v12h4"/></svg></button><span role="status" data-code-status></span></div></details><p><a href="https://github.com/kujolang/kujo/blob/2cfaf185ad03059c89ef4f72fb061074255d00fc/examples/00-hello.kujo">Pinned source</a> · <a href="https://docs.kujolang.ai/learn/">Language documentation</a> · <a href="/examples/hello-world/">Full example</a></p></article>
<article class="example-panel" id="example-functions" data-example="functions" data-category="Basics"><p class="eyebrow">Basics · Executed offline</p><h3>Functions and operators</h3><p>Add the numbers in an array with a function.</p><div class="sample-code"><pre tabindex="0"><code><span class="syntax-token syntax-comment"># Expected output:</span>
<span class="syntax-token syntax-comment"># total: 42</span>

<span class="syntax-token syntax-keyword">func</span> total(values) {
    <span class="syntax-token syntax-keyword">mut</span> sum := <span class="syntax-token syntax-number">0</span>
    <span class="syntax-token syntax-keyword">for</span> value <span class="syntax-token syntax-keyword">in</span> values {
        sum = sum + value
    }
    <span class="syntax-token syntax-keyword">return</span> sum
}

<span class="syntax-token syntax-keyword">let</span> scores := [<span class="syntax-token syntax-number">8</span>, <span class="syntax-token syntax-number">13</span>, <span class="syntax-token syntax-number">21</span>]
print(<span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;total: &quot;</span> + to_string(total(scores)))
</code></pre><button type="button" class="sk-button code-copy-icon" data-copy-code aria-label="Copy code" title="Copy code" hidden><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="8" y="8" width="12" height="12" rx="1.5"/><path d="M16 8V4H4v12h4"/></svg></button><span role="status" data-code-status></span></div><p>Save as <a href="/samples/functions.kujo" download>functions.kujo</a>, then:</p><div class="sample-code"><pre tabindex="0"><code>kujo run functions.kujo</code></pre><button type="button" class="sk-button code-copy-icon" data-copy-code aria-label="Copy code" title="Copy code" hidden><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="8" y="8" width="12" height="12" rx="1.5"/><path d="M16 8V4H4v12h4"/></svg></button><span role="status" data-code-status></span></div><details><summary>Expected output</summary><div class="sample-code"><pre tabindex="0"><code>total: 42
</code></pre><button type="button" class="sk-button code-copy-icon" data-copy-code aria-label="Copy code" title="Copy code" hidden><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="8" y="8" width="12" height="12" rx="1.5"/><path d="M16 8V4H4v12h4"/></svg></button><span role="status" data-code-status></span></div></details><p><a href="https://github.com/kujolang/kujo/blob/2cfaf185ad03059c89ef4f72fb061074255d00fc/examples/02-functions.kujo">Pinned source</a> · <a href="https://docs.kujolang.ai/learn/">Language documentation</a> · <a href="/examples/functions/">Full example</a></p></article>
<article class="example-panel" id="example-collections" data-example="collections" data-category="Data"><p class="eyebrow">Data · Executed offline</p><h3>Collections</h3><p>Build a report from arrays and dictionaries.</p><div class="sample-code"><pre tabindex="0"><code><span class="syntax-token syntax-comment"># Expected output:</span>
<span class="syntax-token syntax-comment"># build total: 42</span>

<span class="syntax-token syntax-keyword">let</span> scores := [<span class="syntax-token syntax-number">8</span>, <span class="syntax-token syntax-number">13</span>, <span class="syntax-token syntax-number">21</span>]
<span class="syntax-token syntax-keyword">let</span> report := {<span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;name&quot;</span>: <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;build&quot;</span>, <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;total&quot;</span>: scores[<span class="syntax-token syntax-number">0</span>] + scores[<span class="syntax-token syntax-number">1</span>] + scores[<span class="syntax-token syntax-number">2</span>]}

print(report[<span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;name&quot;</span>] + <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot; total: &quot;</span> + to_string(report[<span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;total&quot;</span>]))
</code></pre><button type="button" class="sk-button code-copy-icon" data-copy-code aria-label="Copy code" title="Copy code" hidden><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="8" y="8" width="12" height="12" rx="1.5"/><path d="M16 8V4H4v12h4"/></svg></button><span role="status" data-code-status></span></div><p>Save as <a href="/samples/collections.kujo" download>collections.kujo</a>, then:</p><div class="sample-code"><pre tabindex="0"><code>kujo run collections.kujo</code></pre><button type="button" class="sk-button code-copy-icon" data-copy-code aria-label="Copy code" title="Copy code" hidden><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="8" y="8" width="12" height="12" rx="1.5"/><path d="M16 8V4H4v12h4"/></svg></button><span role="status" data-code-status></span></div><details><summary>Expected output</summary><div class="sample-code"><pre tabindex="0"><code>build total: 42
</code></pre><button type="button" class="sk-button code-copy-icon" data-copy-code aria-label="Copy code" title="Copy code" hidden><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="8" y="8" width="12" height="12" rx="1.5"/><path d="M16 8V4H4v12h4"/></svg></button><span role="status" data-code-status></span></div></details><p><a href="https://github.com/kujolang/kujo/blob/2cfaf185ad03059c89ef4f72fb061074255d00fc/examples/04-data.kujo">Pinned source</a> · <a href="https://docs.kujolang.ai/learn/">Language documentation</a> · <a href="/examples/collections/">Full example</a></p></article>
<article class="example-panel" id="example-async" data-example="async" data-category="Concurrency"><p class="eyebrow">Concurrency · Executed offline</p><h3>Async tasks</h3><p>Wait for an async function to return a value.</p><div class="sample-code"><pre tabindex="0"><code><span class="syntax-token syntax-comment">// Simple async test</span>

<span class="syntax-token syntax-keyword">async</span> <span class="syntax-token syntax-keyword">func</span> get_value() {
    <span class="syntax-token syntax-keyword">return</span> <span class="syntax-token syntax-number">42</span>;
}

<span class="syntax-token syntax-keyword">let</span> p = get_value();
println(<span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;Promise type: &quot;</span>, type(p));
<span class="syntax-token syntax-keyword">let</span> result = <span class="syntax-token syntax-keyword">await</span> p;
println(<span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;Result: &quot;</span>, result);
</code></pre><button type="button" class="sk-button code-copy-icon" data-copy-code aria-label="Copy code" title="Copy code" hidden><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="8" y="8" width="12" height="12" rx="1.5"/><path d="M16 8V4H4v12h4"/></svg></button><span role="status" data-code-status></span></div><p>Save as <a href="/samples/async.kujo" download>async.kujo</a>, then:</p><div class="sample-code"><pre tabindex="0"><code>kujo run <span class="syntax-token syntax-keyword">async</span>.kujo</code></pre><button type="button" class="sk-button code-copy-icon" data-copy-code aria-label="Copy code" title="Copy code" hidden><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="8" y="8" width="12" height="12" rx="1.5"/><path d="M16 8V4H4v12h4"/></svg></button><span role="status" data-code-status></span></div><details><summary>Expected output</summary><div class="sample-code"><pre tabindex="0"><code>Promise type:  promise
Result:  42
</code></pre><button type="button" class="sk-button code-copy-icon" data-copy-code aria-label="Copy code" title="Copy code" hidden><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="8" y="8" width="12" height="12" rx="1.5"/><path d="M16 8V4H4v12h4"/></svg></button><span role="status" data-code-status></span></div></details><p><a href="https://github.com/kujolang/kujo/blob/2cfaf185ad03059c89ef4f72fb061074255d00fc/examples/simple_async_test.kujo">Pinned source</a> · <a href="https://docs.kujolang.ai/learn/">Language documentation</a> · <a href="/examples/async/">Full example</a></p></article>
<article class="example-panel" id="example-request-hash" data-example="request-hash" data-category="AI runtime"><p class="eyebrow">AI runtime · Executed offline</p><h3>Deterministic AI request IDs</h3><p>Hash an AI request without including credentials.</p><p class="example-note">The credentials are dummy values. This example makes no network request.</p><div class="sample-code"><pre tabindex="0"><code><span class="syntax-token syntax-keyword">func</span> kv(label, value) {
    print(label + <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;: &quot;</span> + value)
}

<span class="syntax-token syntax-keyword">let</span> options_a := {
    <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;endpoint&quot;</span>: <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;https://api.example.test/v1/chat/completions&quot;</span>,
    <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;model&quot;</span>: <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;gpt-demo&quot;</span>,
    <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;api_key&quot;</span>: <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;credential-one&quot;</span>,
    <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;headers&quot;</span>: {
        <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;Authorization&quot;</span>: <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;Bearer credential-one&quot;</span>,
        <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;X-App&quot;</span>: <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;kujo&quot;</span>
    },
    <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;body&quot;</span>: {
        <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;temperature&quot;</span>: <span class="syntax-token syntax-number">0</span>,
        <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;max_tokens&quot;</span>: <span class="syntax-token syntax-number">32</span>
    }
}

<span class="syntax-token syntax-keyword">let</span> options_b := {
    <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;endpoint&quot;</span>: <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;https://api.example.test/v1/chat/completions&quot;</span>,
    <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;model&quot;</span>: <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;gpt-demo&quot;</span>,
    <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;api_key&quot;</span>: <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;credential-two&quot;</span>,
    <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;headers&quot;</span>: {
        <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;Authorization&quot;</span>: <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;Bearer credential-two&quot;</span>,
        <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;X-App&quot;</span>: <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;kujo&quot;</span>
    },
    <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;body&quot;</span>: {
        <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;temperature&quot;</span>: <span class="syntax-token syntax-number">0</span>,
        <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;max_tokens&quot;</span>: <span class="syntax-token syntax-number">32</span>
    }
}

<span class="syntax-token syntax-keyword">let</span> hash_a := ai_request_hash(<span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;Summarize Kujo&quot;</span>, options_a)
<span class="syntax-token syntax-keyword">let</span> hash_b := ai_request_hash(<span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;Summarize Kujo&quot;</span>, options_b)

kv(<span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;hash_length&quot;</span>, to_string(len(hash_a)))
kv(<span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;same_without_credentials&quot;</span>, to_string(hash_a == hash_b))
kv(<span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;hash&quot;</span>, hash_a)
</code></pre><button type="button" class="sk-button code-copy-icon" data-copy-code aria-label="Copy code" title="Copy code" hidden><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="8" y="8" width="12" height="12" rx="1.5"/><path d="M16 8V4H4v12h4"/></svg></button><span role="status" data-code-status></span></div><p>Save as <a href="/samples/request-hash.kujo" download>request-hash.kujo</a>, then:</p><div class="sample-code"><pre tabindex="0"><code>kujo run request-hash.kujo</code></pre><button type="button" class="sk-button code-copy-icon" data-copy-code aria-label="Copy code" title="Copy code" hidden><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="8" y="8" width="12" height="12" rx="1.5"/><path d="M16 8V4H4v12h4"/></svg></button><span role="status" data-code-status></span></div><details><summary>Expected output</summary><div class="sample-code"><pre tabindex="0"><code>hash_length: 64
same_without_credentials: true
hash: a6244047c108dcf58a952ed0a6c70dc04d13ee9aa9dba08eeb623f241fbd37ce
</code></pre><button type="button" class="sk-button code-copy-icon" data-copy-code aria-label="Copy code" title="Copy code" hidden><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="8" y="8" width="12" height="12" rx="1.5"/><path d="M16 8V4H4v12h4"/></svg></button><span role="status" data-code-status></span></div></details><p><a href="https://github.com/kujolang/kujo/blob/2cfaf185ad03059c89ef4f72fb061074255d00fc/examples/ai_request_hash.kujo">Pinned source</a> · <a href="https://docs.kujolang.ai/learn/">Language documentation</a> · <a href="/examples/request-hash/">Full example</a></p></article>
<article class="example-panel" id="example-replay" data-example="replay" data-category="AI runtime"><p class="eyebrow">AI runtime · Executed offline</p><h3>AI calls and replay</h3><p>Replay a recorded model response offline.</p><p class="example-note">Use the samples bundle or the pinned Kujo checkout so the cassette fixtures are available.</p><div class="sample-code"><pre tabindex="0"><code><span class="syntax-token syntax-keyword">func</span> kv(label, value) {
    print(label + <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;: &quot;</span> + value)
}

<span class="syntax-token syntax-keyword">let</span> options := {
    <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;endpoint&quot;</span>: <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;http://127.0.0.1:1/v1/chat/completions&quot;</span>,
    <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;model&quot;</span>: <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;gpt-replay&quot;</span>,
    <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;cassette&quot;</span>: {
        <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;mode&quot;</span>: <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;replay&quot;</span>,
        <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;dir&quot;</span>: <span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;tests/fixtures/ai_cassettes&quot;</span>
    }
}

<span class="syntax-token syntax-keyword">let</span> result := ai_chat(<span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;Hello model&quot;</span>, options)

kv(<span class="syntax-token syntax-string">&quot;replay_result&quot;</span>, to_string(result))
</code></pre><button type="button" class="sk-button code-copy-icon" data-copy-code aria-label="Copy code" title="Copy code" hidden><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="8" y="8" width="12" height="12" rx="1.5"/><path d="M16 8V4H4v12h4"/></svg></button><span role="status" data-code-status></span></div><p>Save as <a href="/samples/replay.kujo" download>replay.kujo</a>, then:</p><div class="sample-code"><pre tabindex="0"><code>kujo run replay.kujo</code></pre><button type="button" class="sk-button code-copy-icon" data-copy-code aria-label="Copy code" title="Copy code" hidden><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="8" y="8" width="12" height="12" rx="1.5"/><path d="M16 8V4H4v12h4"/></svg></button><span role="status" data-code-status></span></div><details><summary>Expected output</summary><div class="sample-code"><pre tabindex="0"><code>replay_result: Ok({&quot;finish_reason&quot;: tool_calls, &quot;headers&quot;: {&quot;content-type&quot;: application/json}, &quot;json&quot;: {&quot;choices&quot;: [{&quot;finish_reason&quot;: tool_calls, &quot;message&quot;: {&quot;content&quot;: hello from cassette, &quot;tool_calls&quot;: [{&quot;function&quot;: {&quot;arguments&quot;: {&quot;query&quot;:&quot;kujo&quot;}, &quot;name&quot;: lookup}, &quot;id&quot;: call_1}]}}], &quot;usage&quot;: {&quot;completion_tokens&quot;: 5, &quot;prompt_tokens&quot;: 7, &quot;total_tokens&quot;: 12}}, &quot;message&quot;: hello from cassette, &quot;model&quot;: gpt-replay, &quot;provider&quot;: , &quot;status&quot;: 200, &quot;text&quot;: {&quot;choices&quot;:[{&quot;finish_reason&quot;:&quot;tool_calls&quot;,&quot;message&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:&quot;hello from cassette&quot;,&quot;tool_calls&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;call_1&quot;,&quot;function&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;lookup&quot;,&quot;arguments&quot;:&quot;{\&quot;query\&quot;:\&quot;kujo\&quot;}&quot;}}]}}],&quot;usage&quot;:{&quot;prompt_tokens&quot;:7,&quot;completion_tokens&quot;:5,&quot;total_tokens&quot;:12}}, &quot;tool_calls&quot;: [{&quot;arguments_json&quot;: {&quot;query&quot;:&quot;kujo&quot;}, &quot;id&quot;: call_1, &quot;name&quot;: lookup}], &quot;usage&quot;: {&quot;completion_tokens&quot;: 5, &quot;prompt_tokens&quot;: 7, &quot;total_tokens&quot;: 12}})
</code></pre><button type="button" class="sk-button code-copy-icon" data-copy-code aria-label="Copy code" title="Copy code" hidden><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="8" y="8" width="12" height="12" rx="1.5"/><path d="M16 8V4H4v12h4"/></svg></button><span role="status" data-code-status></span></div></details><p><a href="https://github.com/kujolang/kujo/blob/2cfaf185ad03059c89ef4f72fb061074255d00fc/examples/ai_replay_cassette.kujo">Pinned source</a> · <a href="https://docs.kujolang.ai/learn/">Language documentation</a> · <a href="/examples/replay/">Full example</a></p></article><a class="sk-button" href="/examples/">Explore all examples</a></section>
