<section class="language-section home-build" aria-labelledby="build-title">
<header class="home-section-heading"><h2 id="build-title">Small scripts.<br>Real building blocks.</h2></header>
<div class="home-card-grid">
<article class="home-card"><span class="home-card-mark" aria-hidden="true">[ / ]</span><h3>Automate local work</h3><p>Read files, run processes and work with JSON. Write a script for the jobs you repeat.</p><a href="/examples/files/">File operations ↗</a></article>
<article class="home-card"><span class="home-card-mark" aria-hidden="true">{ : }</span><h3>Build applications</h3><p>Build a service with HTTP helpers, modules and async functions.</p><a href="/examples/http/">HTTP server ↗</a></article>
<article class="home-card"><span class="home-card-mark" aria-hidden="true">&gt;_</span><h3>Work with AI</h3><p>Replay model responses and check that the data has the shape you expect.</p><a href="/examples/replay/">Offline AI call ↗</a></article>
</div></section>
<section class="home-runtime" aria-labelledby="runtime-title"><div class="home-runtime-inner">
<header><h2 id="runtime-title">Repeat the request.<br>Inspect the result.</h2><p>Check an AI request, replay its response and validate the data it returns.</p><a href="/compare/">Compare language approaches ↗</a></header>
<div class="home-runtime-steps"><article><span aria-hidden="true">01</span><div><h3>Identify</h3><p><code>ai_request_hash</code> creates a stable request ID without including credentials.</p><a href="/examples/request-hash/">Inspect a request hash</a></div></article><article><span aria-hidden="true">02</span><div><h3>Replay</h3><p><code>ai_chat</code> replays recorded responses without calling a model.</p><a href="/examples/replay/">Run a recorded response</a></div></article><article><span aria-hidden="true">03</span><div><h3>Validate</h3><p>Check the response shape with <code>json_schema_validate</code>.</p><a href="/examples/structured-output/">Validate structured output</a></div></article></div>
<p class="home-runtime-note"><a href="/language/">Explore the language and its boundaries ↗</a></p>
</div></section>
<section class="language-section home-start" id="get-started" aria-labelledby="start-title"><header><h2 id="start-title">Run your<br>first script.</h2><p>Install the runtime with Node.js 18 or newer on supported macOS, Linux or Windows systems.</p><a href="/language/">Installation guide &amp; troubleshooting ↗</a></header><div class="home-terminal"><div class="home-terminal-bar"><span aria-hidden="true">● ● ●</span><span>Terminal / Quick start</span></div><p>01 — Install the runtime</p><div class="sample-code"><pre tabindex="0"><code>npm install --global @kujolang/kujo-runtime</code></pre><button type="button" class="sk-button code-copy-icon" data-copy-code aria-label="Copy code" title="Copy code" hidden><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="8" y="8" width="12" height="12" rx="1.5"/><path d="M16 8V4H4v12h4"/></svg></button><span role="status" data-code-status></span></div><p>02 — Save this as <code>hello.kujo</code></p><div class="sample-code"><pre tabindex="0"><code>print("Hello, Kujo!")</code></pre><button type="button" class="sk-button code-copy-icon" data-copy-code aria-label="Copy code" title="Copy code" hidden><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="8" y="8" width="12" height="12" rx="1.5"/><path d="M16 8V4H4v12h4"/></svg></button><span role="status" data-code-status></span></div><p>03 — Check and run</p><div class="sample-code"><pre tabindex="0"><code>kujo check hello.kujo
kujo run hello.kujo</code></pre><button type="button" class="sk-button code-copy-icon" data-copy-code aria-label="Copy code" title="Copy code" hidden><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="8" y="8" width="12" height="12" rx="1.5"/><path d="M16 8V4H4v12h4"/></svg></button><span role="status" data-code-status></span></div><p class="home-terminal-result">↳ Hello, Kujo!</p></div></section>
